python
# RATIO_COMPACTNESS_ELONGATEDNESS
# Ratio of COMPACTNESS to ELONGATEDNESS highlights balance between shape compactness and elongation.
# Usefulness: Vehicles with different profiles will feature varying compactness-elongation balances.
