end

python
# PRODUCT_ASYMMETRY_SKEWNESS
# Interaction product of ASYMMETRY_INTENSITY and SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS emphasizes asymmetry-skew coupling.
# Usefulness: Asymmetry-skew coupling is critical for identifying distinct structural imbalances in silhouette orientation.
